note("S5.3 forbids asking the container, and this is why.")
elseif ok and detail.maxCount and limit == detail.maxCount then
note("they agree on this pack now -- S5.3 still stands, since believing")
note("what a transfer RETURNED costs nothing and cannot be wrong (S5.5)")
end
end
end



